"Both need the Claude Code hook and stay quiet while a terminal or editor is frontmost and inside the quiet hours. A glance opens the panel for a few seconds with the session line and settles again unless the pointer comes in; under Reduce Motion it opens without animation and stays a little longer. A \"waiting\" notice is withdrawn when you answer. In an unsigned build no notice can break through Focus or Do Not Disturb; the time-sensitive ones (running out, waiting for you) do in the signed release." = "兩者都需要 Claude Code hook，且在終端機或編輯器位於最前、以及安靜時段內保持安靜。「一瞥」會將面板連同工作階段行開啟幾秒後再收起，除非指標移入；開啟「減少動態效果」時無動畫開啟並停留稍久。你回覆後「等待中」通知會被撤回。未簽署的組建中任何通知都無法突破專注模式或勿擾模式；簽署版本中的時效性通知（即將用盡、等待你）可以。";
