"Claude Code recreates its Keychain item on every token refresh, which forgets the Always Allow you gave. A timed read never raises the dialog: it reads the item through Apple's security tool, which Claude Code wrote it with, then the credentials file, then the status line, and otherwise keeps the last reading marked \"needs your OK\". Only a click on the Claude ring, Refresh or the Assistants toggle may ask, and only under On Refresh only." = "Claude Code 每次更新權杖都會重建鑰匙圈項目，從而忘記你給的「永遠允許」。定時讀取絕不彈出對話框：它先透過 Apple 的 security 工具（Claude Code 正是用它寫入該項目）讀取，再讀憑證檔案，再讀狀態列，否則保留上次讀數並標記「需要你的確認」。只有點擊 Claude 環、重新整理或助理開關才可能詢問，且僅在「僅重新整理時」下。";
