"The first assistant sits left of the notch and the rest to its right; the panel's cards and the edge pills follow the same order. Peak hours applies Anthropic's weekday window (Advanced) to that assistant's advice and projections." = "第一個助理位於瀏海左側，其餘位於右側；面板卡片和邊緣膠囊沿用同一順序。「尖峰時段」將 Anthropic 的平日時段（進階）套用於該助理的建議和預測。";
